#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:1
msgid "E3027"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:3
msgid ""
"`guard!` cannot have an `else` clause. It is the explicit form of a "
"terminating guard: when its condition is false or its pattern does not "
"match, the program terminates."
msgstr ""
"`guard!` に `else` 節を付けることはできません。これは終了する guard の明示的な形式であり、"
"条件が false の場合やパターンが一致しない場合はプログラムが終了します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:7
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:9
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn require(condition : Bool) -> Bool {\n"
"  guard! condition else { false }\n"
"  true\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:13
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正方法"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:15
msgid "Use `guard` when an `else` clause is needed."
msgstr "`else` 節が必要な場合は `guard` を使用します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E3027.md:17
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn require(condition : Bool) -> Bool {\n"
"  guard condition else { false }\n"
"  true\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
